    "---\n",
    "# Task 1: Sampling Methods\n",
    "Before analysing any data, we must understand how it was collected. The sampling method determines whether the sample is representative of the population.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Goal:** Implement random, systematic, and stratified sampling on the Diabetes dataset and compare each sample's mean Glucose against the population mean."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "task1-setup",
   "metadata": {},
